ly:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">I am also having the following warnings:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">1: running command &#39;exiftool -q -f -t -r -Directory -FileName -EXIF:DateTimeOriginal -HierarchicalSubject -ext JPG &quot;/Volumes/Untitled/2017&amp;2018_photos copy/2017-photos&quot;&#39; had status 1<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">2: In strptime(x = metadata.tmp$DateTimeOriginal, format = &quot;%Y:%m:%d %H:%M:%S&quot;,  ... :<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">  unknown timezone &#39;zone/tz/2018e.1.0/zoneinfo/America/Los_Angeles&#39;<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">3: In as.POSIXct.POSIXlt(strptime(x = metadata.tmp$DateTimeOriginal,  ... :<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Any help would be greatly appreciated! Like I said, I am new to R, so hopefully this is just a simple fix that I am overlooking.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Ali<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div>"
